      "title": "Detected another Sber integration",
      "description": "Two integrations for Sber devices are installed: SberHome and {domains}. Running two integrations against the same Sber account at once can cause conflicts — intercepted state updates, incorrect mode display, command races. It is recommended to keep only one of them enabled."
